    <!-- FAQ posts -->
    <item>
      <title>What is decision intelligence?</title>
      <wp:post_id>10002</wp:post_id>
      <wp:post_date>2025-01-01 00:00:00</wp:post_date>
      <wp:post_date_gmt>2025-01-01 00:00:00</wp:post_date_gmt>
      <wp:comment_status>closed</wp:comment_status>
      <wp:ping_status>closed</wp:ping_status>
      <wp:post_name>what-is-decision-intelligence</wp:post_name>
      <wp:status>publish</wp:status>
      <wp:post_parent>0</wp:post_parent>
      <wp:menu_order>1</wp:menu_order>
      <wp:post_type>faq</wp:post_type>
      <wp:is_sticky>0</wp:is_sticky>
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[Decision intelligence (DI) is a discipline that integrates data, analytics, AI, and automation into a continuous loop to improve how decisions are made across the enterprise.]]></content:encoded>
    </item>

    <item>
      <title>What are the key benefits of decision intelligence?</title>
      <wp:post_id>10003</wp:post_id>
      <wp:post_date>2025-01-01 00:00:00</wp:post_date>
      <wp:post_date_gmt>2025-01-01 00:00:00</wp:post_date_gmt>
      <wp:comment_status>closed</wp:comment_status>
      <wp:ping_status>closed</wp:ping_status>
      <wp:post_name>decision-intelligence-benefits</wp:post_name>
      <wp:status>publish</wp:status>
      <wp:post_parent>0</wp:post_parent>
      <wp:menu_order>2</wp:menu_order>
      <wp:post_type>faq</wp:post_type>
      <wp:is_sticky>0</wp:is_sticky>
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[DI delivers accuracy, frequency, granularity, automation, and coverage by combining harmonized data, analytics, and automation to recommend or execute better actions.]]></content:encoded>
    </item>

    <item>
      <title>Why is decision intelligence becoming essential?</title>
      <wp:post_id>10004</wp:post_id>
      <wp:post_date>2025-01-01 00:00:00</wp:post_date>
      <wp:post_date_gmt>2025-01-01 00:00:00</wp:post_date_gmt>
      <wp:comment_status>closed</wp:comment_status>
      <wp:ping_status>closed</wp:ping_status>
      <wp:post_name>why-decision-intelligence-essential</wp:post_name>
      <wp:status>publish</wp:status>
      <wp:post_parent>0</wp:post_parent>
      <wp:menu_order>3</wp:menu_order>
      <wp:post_type>faq</wp:post_type>
      <wp:is_sticky>0</wp:is_sticky>
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[Enterprises face rising volume and complexity of decisions. DI embeds AI and automation into workflows, shifting teams from reactive reporting to proactive execution.]]></content:encoded>
    </item>

    <item>
      <title>How does human-AI collaboration work in decision intelligence?</title>
      <wp:post_id>10005</wp:post_id>
      <wp:post_date>2025-01-01 00:00:00</wp:post_date>
      <wp:post_date_gmt>2025-01-01 00:00:00</wp:post_date_gmt>
      <wp:comment_status>closed</wp:comment_status>
      <wp:ping_status>closed</wp:ping_status>
      <wp:post_name>human-ai-collaboration-decision-intelligence</wp:post_name>
      <wp:status>publish</wp:status>
      <wp:post_parent>0</wp:post_parent>
      <wp:menu_order>4</wp:menu_order>
      <wp:post_type>faq</wp:post_type>
      <wp:is_sticky>0</wp:is_sticky>
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[DI supports human-in-the-loop, human-on-the-loop, and human-out-of-the-loop modes: from decision support to recommendations to autonomous execution with guardrails.]]></content:encoded>
    </item>

    <item>
      <title>Which industries can use decision intelligence?</title>
      <wp:post_id>10006</wp:post_id>
      <wp:post_date>2025-01-01 00:00:00</wp:post_date>
      <wp:post_date_gmt>2025-01-01 00:00:00</wp:post_date_gmt>
      <wp:comment_status>closed</wp:comment_status>
      <wp:ping_status>closed</wp:ping_status>
      <wp:post_name>industries-decision-intelligence</wp:post_name>
      <wp:status>publish</wp:status>
      <wp:post_parent>0</wp:post_parent>
      <wp:menu_order>5</wp:menu_order>
      <wp:post_type>faq</wp:post_type>
      <wp:is_sticky>0</wp:is_sticky>
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[DI is used across manufacturing, retail and CPG, life sciences, energy, and financial services to improve forecasting, replenishment, logistics, risk, and more.]]></content:encoded>
    </item>

  </channel>
